    "hysteresis": "Two-point deadband; brighten at >=3 points; dim after3 consecutive lower frames, at most5 points/frame.",
    "raw_guards": "NEW, INVALID/gain, configuration readback, conservative FFFF saturation; last valid frame expires5s.",
    "fault": "Closes mode, restores manual value/custom entry; only explicit enable retries uncertain cleanup. No physical five-second I/O hard deadline.",
    "scheduling": "No new thread/timer/I2C owner. Qualified normal ACTIVE/DIM only; OFF/AOD/flashlight/endurance/panel diagnostic pause. Existing IDLE responsibility until verified restore.",
    "persistence": "v12,24B,byte10=0/1 mode; manual byte3 unchanged; v1-4/6-11 defaultoff, v5 rejected; existing debounce/readback worker.",
    "output": "UI runtime value is separate; existing OFF/DIM/flashlight100/AOD8 and first-frame wake arbitration retained."
